As mentioned, the default "top" setting is for only 1 CPU-related line to
be displayed. Do an "h" and see what option will allow more granularity;
I think that "1" will do what you want...

> cat /proc/cpuinfo:
> cpus detected           : 4
> cpus active             : 4
